// DEPRECATED umbrella — no longer a build-configuration base config.
//
// The original design pointed every Xcode build configuration at this single
// umbrella and relied on `#include "$(CONFIGURATION).xcconfig"` to pull in the
// per-variant file. That never worked: Xcode does NOT expand `$(CONFIGURATION)`
// (or any build setting) inside an xcconfig `#include` path, so the per-variant
// KMPF_VARIANT / PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER values silently never loaded.
//
// Fix: project.pbxproj now sets each build configuration's base config directly
// to its own Configs/<variant>.xcconfig (demoDebug.xcconfig, prodRelease.xcconfig,
// …). Those files are self-contained (flavor identity via $(APP_BUNDLE_ID) from
// the project-level Config.xcconfig, plus a per-config CocoaPods #include?).
//
// This file is retained only because GenerateIosFlavorXcconfigsTask never deletes
// it; nothing references it anymore.
